ts using official pricing\n  // Assuming cache_creation_input_tokens are 5m cache writes (most common in Claude Code)\n  const haikuCost =\n    (stats.haikuTokens.input / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].input +\n    (stats.haikuTokens.output / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].output +\n    (stats.haikuTokens.cacheCreation / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].cacheWrite5m +\n    (stats.haikuTokens.cacheRead / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].cacheRead;\n\n  const sonnetCost =\n    (stats.sonnetTokens.input / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].input +\n    (stats.sonnetTokens.output / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].output +\n    (stats.sonnetTokens.cacheCreation / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].cacheWrite5m +\n    (stats.sonnetTokens.cacheRead / 1_000_000) * PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].cacheRead;\n\n  const report = `# API Usage Analysis Report\n\n## Analysis Period\n**seven_day utilization: 3 \u2192 5**\n\n- **Start Time:** ${stats.utilizationStart || 'N/A'}\n- **End Time:** ${stats.utilizationEnd || 'N/A'}\n\n---\n\n## LLM Requests Summary\n\n### Total Requests to \\`https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages?beta=true\\`\n**${stats.totalLLMRequests}** requests\n\n---\n\n## Requests by Model\n\n| Model | Requests |\n|-------|----------|\n| Claude 3.5 Haiku (claude-3-5-haiku-20241022) | ${stats.haikuRequests} |\n| Claude Sonnet 4.5 (claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929) | ${stats.sonnetRequests} |\n\n---\n\n## Token Counts\n\n### Haiku (claude-3-5-haiku-20241022)\n\n| Token Type | Count |\n|------------|-------|\n| Input | ${stats.haikuTokens.input.toLocaleString()} |\n| Output | ${stats.haikuTokens.output.toLocaleString()} |\n| Cache Creation | ${stats.haikuTokens.cacheCreation.toLocaleString()} |\n| Cache Read | ${stats.haikuTokens.cacheRead.toLocaleString()} |\n| **Total (Input + Output)** | **${(stats.haikuTokens.input + stats.haikuTokens.output).toLocaleString()}** |\n\n### Sonnet (claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929)\n\n| Token Type | Count |\n|------------|-------|\n| Input | ${stats.sonnetTokens.input.toLocaleString()} |\n| Output | ${stats.sonnetTokens.output.toLocaleString()} |\n| Cache Creation | ${stats.sonnetTokens.cacheCreation.toLocaleString()} |\n| Cache Read | ${stats.sonnetTokens.cacheRead.toLocaleString()} |\n| **Total (Input + Output)** | **${(stats.sonnetTokens.input + stats.sonnetTokens.output).toLocaleString()}** |\n\n---\n\n## Cost Analysis\n\n### Pricing (per million tokens)\n\n**Haiku 3.5:**\n- Base Input: $${PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].input.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n- Output: $${PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].output.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n- Cache Write (5m): $${PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].cacheWrite5m.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n- Cache Hits: $${PRICING['claude-3-5-haiku-20241022'].cacheRead.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n\n**Sonnet 4.5:**\n- Base Input: $${PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].input.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n- Output: $${PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].output.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n- Cache Write (5m): $${PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].cacheWrite5m.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n- Cache Hits: $${PRICING['claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929'].cacheRead.toFixed(2)}/MTok\n\n### Estimated Costs\n\n| Model | Cost |\n|-------|------|\n| Haiku | $${haikuCost.toFixed(4)} |\n| Sonnet | $${sonnetCost.toFixed(4)} |\n| **Total** | **$${(haikuCost + sonnetCost).toFixed(4)}** |\n\n---\n\n*Report generated on ${new Date().toISOString()}*\n`;\n\n  fs.writeFileSync(outputFile, report);\n  console.log(`\\n\u2705 Report written to: ${outputFile}`);\n\n  // Also display to console\n  console.log('\\n' + '='.repeat(70));\n  console.log('SUMMARY');\n  console.log('='.repeat(70));\n  console.log(`Total LLM Requests: ${stats.totalLLMRequests}`);\n  console.log(`Haiku Requests: ${stats.haikuRequests}`);\n  console.log(`Sonnet Requests: ${stats.sonnetRequests}`);\n  console.log(`Total Cost: $${(haikuCost + sonnetCost).toFixed(4)}`);\n  console.log('='.repeat(70));\n}\n\nanalyzeData().catch(console.error);\n```\n\nPlease provide a thorough architectural analysis with specific, actionable recommendations for improvement.",
